  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a9c3631d-0fd9-4c02-9acd-ffc22b12790f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_16063ff8-491b-4009-9fa9-59e5c01050ed.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"></p><p>海豚俯衝動作完全仿照《決勝時刻》，讓玩家能夠快速向前衝刺並著地，實現戰鬥中的迅速重新定位。</p><p>必備模組：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TACZ</a></span></p><p>衝刺時按下 C 鍵即可俯衝</p><p>強烈推薦：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PlayerAnimator（更流暢的動畫效果）</a></span></p><p>必備模組：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth_config</a></span></p><p>使用與授權條款<br>您可以在影片或直播中使用此模組。<br>請在說明處標註我的貢獻。</p><p>禁止事項：<br>- 販售此模組<br>- 重新上傳此模組<br>- 修改或重新分發此模組</p>",
